      "created_at": "2012-05-03T20:40:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Paul&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Paul\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hey everyone!  I just noticed that, while the SotM core game has nearly 600 ratings on BGG, Rook City only has 67, which is too low to even be ranked.  I know for a fact that more than 67 people own the game - if any of you on here are on BGG and have not yet rated Rook City, you totally should! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/boardgameexpansion/110242/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-rook-city\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Sentinels of the Multiverse: Rook City | Board Game | BoardGameGeek</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Wow, rating on BGG is non-intuitive.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/392309/how-to-rate-a-game\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f632de3911b06770cee8de0c8a226151b65dbffa.png\" class=\"site-icon\" data-dominant-color=\"FF5100\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/392309/how-to-rate-a-game\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BoardGameGeek</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/362;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d7da1951824d8aa3d75b726f75bb277b1a623926_2_690x362.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" data-dominant-color=\"342738\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/392309/how-to-rate-a-game\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to rate a game? | BGG</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Greetings,\n\nI've been on this board for years and never been able to find out how to give a game a rating. How do you rate a game? And how do you leave a personal comment (the kind that factors into the ratings, with the colored 1-10 box</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
